MAX_OUT: defaults to 400 unless ORLY_MAX_CHECK_OUT is set
CACHE_NAME: is "checks.json"
cached: returns only entries whose fingerprint equals the given fingerprint
checkEnricher: runs only the checks that some spec's require path names
checkEnricher: runs the commands in parallel with Promise.all
checkEnricher: records matches as null when the countPattern is not a valid regular expression
